OL,6,G1900 The Box
OL,7,     FAs the competition passes the
OL,8,     Fhalfway point, Gary Lineker tests
OL,9,     Fthe mettle of the remaining
OL,10,     Fcelebrities in a spine-chilling
OL,11,     Findividual challenge. With no one
OL,12,     Fto rely on but themselves, those
OL,13,     Fwith the most backbone are
OL,14,     Frewarded. A mystery box returns
OL,15,     Fand one team captain must decide
OL,16,     Fwhether to gamble for a potential
OL,17,     Fadvantage - but nothing is ever
OL,18,     Fpredictable. In the team
OL,19,     Fchallenge, romance is in the air -
OL,20,     Fbut the love is short-lived as a
OL,21,     Fcruel rule change sparks tension.
