OL,5,G0350 Unwind with STV
OL,6,     FDaily escape designed to calm the
OL,7,     Fmind and encourage relaxation and
OL,8,     Freflection
OL,9,G0505 Dermot's Taste of Ireland
OL,10,     FOn the sweeping sands of Benone
OL,11,     FStrand in Co Derry, Dermot O'Leary
OL,12,     Frolls up his trousers and wades
OL,13,     Finto the sea to harvest water for
OL,14,     Fsalt-making, learning the
OL,15,     Ftraditional process of creating
OL,16,     Fsea salt over an open fire right
OL,17,     Fon the beach. Travelling on to
OL,18,     FColeraine, Dermot tries lobster
OL,19,     Ffishing and visits LIR seafood
OL,20,     Frestaurant, where the chefs
OL,21,     Fchampion a zero-waste approach to
OL,22,     Fcooking
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG6/7
